{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/extras/5c13900e15b6e878e7934c7cad6c19f7.poster.avif?t=1752609234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/extras/5c13900e15b6e878e7934c7cad6c19f7.webm?t=1752609234\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/extras/5c13900e15b6e878e7934c7cad6c19f7.mp4?t=1752609234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cTable Tactics\u201d is a unique blend of strategy and physics, played with little miniature figurines. Imagine you are staring at your kitchen table where you laid out a little fantasy diorama and carefully placed miniatures to defend your castle. Alas, enemy units are coming from all directions! But instead of decreasing their health or worrying about armor, you must physically knock them over by shooting various projectiles (like arrows or marbles), using traps, or pushing them off the table. You\u2019ll need to take the shape and weight of each figurine into consideration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/extras/f3ac2d97d969a4aaff2d7b29423d5964.poster.avif?t=1752609234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/extras/f3ac2d97d969a4aaff2d7b29423d5964.webm?t=1752609234\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/extras/f3ac2d97d969a4aaff2d7b29423d5964.mp4?t=1752609234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">one Single Player mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a local PvP skirmish mode for 2 to 4 players, with two different game modes and two different maps to play on</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Single Player</u> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your castle against waves of enemies! Earn coins for each enemy topped and spend them to build new defensive units.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Point Control (PvP)</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move your units inside one of the control points, and keep them safe until the next turn to earn points. The first team to reach the point limit wins the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Castle Bomb\u00a0(PvP)</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push the heavy bomb into the enemy castle - and keep the enemy from pushig it into yours. A physical tug-of-war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/extras/afdb9dd19d00ffdc776ae597ad132a0f.poster.avif?t=1752609234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/extras/afdb9dd19d00ffdc776ae597ad132a0f.webm?t=1752609234\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/extras/afdb9dd19d00ffdc776ae597ad132a0f.mp4?t=1752609234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866470?t=1752609234","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/07d22c064a58f2d635822f979d6c2bbb428e5bc9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752609234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866470/9cc081842b597532ed35fd03d94e2d3a96408ea4/c